OL,3,ABadenoch says Tories would scrap
OL,4,Ainheritance tax on family homes and
OL,5,Aallow couples to leave extra #1m
OL,6,
OL,7,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,8,Fpledges to make changes to inheritance
OL,9,Ftax, meaning people will be able to
OL,10,Fpass on their family homes without
OL,11,Fpaying the tax, and couples will be
OL,12,Fable to leave an extra #1m tax-free
OL,14,FIn her speech at the Conservative
OL,15,Fconference, Badenoch outlines how her
OL,16,Fparty will look to boost growth, create
OL,17,Fjobs, cut energy costs, cut welfare,
OL,18,Ftackle crime and pay for defence -
OL,19,Fadding the Tories face a "battle for
OL,20,Fthe soul of the nation"
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
