OL,5,AOctober attacks
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsrael does not allow international
OL,8,Fnews organisations, including the BBC,
OL,9,Finto Gaza to report freely
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
